719
00:47:22,950 --> 00:47:26,710
Not directly, but they're influencing the market.

720
00:47:27,310 --> 00:47:32,760
Their stability allows them to invest slowly and methodically in R&D.

721
00:47:32,820 --> 00:47:48,130
